  "title": "Tradeweb Expands Kalshi Prediction Market Data, Index into Institutional Trading Workflows",
  "summary": "NEW YORK – JUNE 24, 2026 – Tradeweb Markets Inc. (Nasdaq: TW), a global leader in electronic trading across asset classes, today announced the launch of a dedicated Kalshi pricing page on the Tradeweb platform, giving U.S. institutional clients access to key event contract data alongside the existing tools and information they use to analyze markets and manage risk.",
